Download stream (ioctl index 0), 163,840 bytes:
00000 - 07FFF   32K  program ROM (CPU 8000-FFFF)   -> SDRAM bank 0
08000 - 1FFFF   96K  graphics ROMs GR0-GR2         -> SDRAM bank 0
20000 - 27FFF   32K  sound program                 -> SDRAM bank 2
    </romstruct>

    <rom index="1">
